{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103141","id":2350791186,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6MHjoS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103141","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103141.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103141.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103141","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103141/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103141/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103141/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4eb01a9712ffab9c4471366b00cba46e69bff0a6","number":103141,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Change sRGB -> linear conversions to be more accurate in the compatibility renderer","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #103124 .\r\nFixes #94863 \r\n\r\nThe current sRGB <-> linear conversion functions in the compatibility renderer are cheaper approximations of the actual ones. These approximations, as evidenced by both the bug and a later comment on the blog post they're sourced from, cause color distortion when a round trip is performed. \r\n\r\nSince the compatibility renderer performs an sRGB -> linear -> sRGB conversion every frame, the image in #103124 gets increasingly distorted. \r\n\r\nBased on #103124, only the sRGB -> linear function needs to be replaced to allow for stable round trips, so this only updates that one. It does add a pow to a function that didn't have one before, but the reverse function already includes a use of pow, so hopefully this one is alright to add.\r\n\r\nThe updated sRGB conversion function is sourced from [another renderer](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4254946de93bab0cc1fb36a7b9039c9ec43be924/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/effects/copy_to_fb.glsl#L129). If there's a good way to share the function let me know, sticking to the existing structure for now.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/